  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mn>3&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of acetic acid is added to <math><mn>250&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0.1&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> and the solution made up to <math><mn>500&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>.&nbsp;To&nbsp;<math><mn>20&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> of this solution <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2&#160;</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> is added. The <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math> of the solution is ________<br />[Given: <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> of acetic acid <math><mo>=</mo><mn>4.75</mn><mo>,</mo></math> molar mass of acetic acid <math><mn>60&#160;</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4771</mn></math>&nbsp;, Neglect any changes in volume]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "5.22",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>millimole&nbsp;of acetic acid in <math><mn>20</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br />millimole&nbsp;of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> <em>in</em> <math><mn>20</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />millimole&nbsp;of<em>&nbsp;</em>&nbsp;<math><mi>N</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.5</mn></math><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/b56d535d-8549-4014-8f0b-72a5451643dc-image.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 141px;\" /></p><p><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn><mi></mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4.74</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>4.74</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.48</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5.22</mn></math></p>",
